	(gr_text "Seen from the front (display side); the F side faces the display.\nThe board sits on the boss faces 17 mm behind the front of RB02D_-_case, inside its 72 mm tube; the\nnotch at the top left clears a block that stands 0.7 mm proud of them.\nThe top right boss is 2 mm deeper: put a 2 mm spacer under the board there.\n3 x M2 screws thread into the printed 1.8 mm pilots.\nDwgs.User shows the case cut at the board plane."
		(at 109.510799 110.9876 0)
